WEBVTT

00:33:59.904 --> 00:34:01.055
CH: Yeah.

00:34:01.079 --> 00:34:02.562
That's such an important point,

00:34:02.586 --> 00:34:05.579
and I think all of us here
would say "thank you"

00:34:05.603 --> 00:34:09.221
to, you know, the different people
helping out in this situation.

00:34:09.245 --> 00:34:11.980
We do need each other.

00:34:12.004 --> 00:34:15.695
I do want to get
to this issue of capitalism.

00:34:15.719 --> 00:34:17.822
Because when we talked a few days ago,

00:34:17.846 --> 00:34:21.204
you mentioned -- and earlier
in this conversation as well --

00:34:21.228 --> 00:34:24.982
how, you know, this period of time
we can emerge stronger and better

00:34:25.006 --> 00:34:26.331
than before.

00:34:26.355 --> 00:34:29.386
And about a year ago, you wrote a piece

00:34:29.410 --> 00:34:33.418
about how capitalism needs to be reformed,